            {
               "text": "### Images from Archive\n\nThese images are copyrighted by Archive and may be used under the license they have established.\n\nTo view all images, use the left and right arrows in the gallery below.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htSlides\">\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">1 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgBRES140\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgBRES140', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Excerpt from a letter by Christopher Columbus describing islands inhabited by numerous people (<htcite5>).</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Who truly discovered America (Abya Yala)? - This text explores the concept of discovery and questions who truly arrived first in the Americas. (<htcite0>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">2 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgLL\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgLL', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Portrait of Lucrecia Leme, a member of the Lem/Leme family.</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>This image will be used in an upcoming game, currently in development.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">3 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgPD\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgPD', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Excerpt from the estate inventory of Pedro Dias.</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>This image will be used in an upcoming game, currently in development.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">4 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"Experiment\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('Experiment', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Optical diagram from the treatise of Ibn al-Haytham (Alhazen) (<htcite6>).</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Scientific method: This text examines the work of Ibn al-Haytham and traces the development of the scientific method. (<htcite1>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">5 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgPoma\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgPoma', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Page from the manuscript by Felipe Guaman Poma de Ayala, freely available on Archive.org (<htcite4>).</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Reading the Quipu on the Yupana - This game shows how to read a number recorded on the quipu and represent it on the Yupana (<htcite2>).</li>\n<li>Yupana (multiplication) - This text explains how to perform multiplication on the Yupana using the method of repeated addition (<htcite3>).</li>\n<li>Mesoamerican sums - We studied how the Mesoamericans might have used addition in their numerical system. (<htcite7>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">6 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgPomaCalendar\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgPomaCalendar', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">First page of the chapter on the months and years in the manuscript by Felipe Guaman Poma de Ayala, freely available on Archive.org (<htcite10>).</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>The beginning - the marking of time demands a beginning. But what would it be? (<htcite11>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"htSlide\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCounter\">7 / 7</div>\n<img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgMundus\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgMundus', '0%')\">\n<div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Page 1 of the letter of Amerigo Vespucci to Lorenzo Pietro di Medici (<htcite8>).</div>\n<div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Expanding... - Continuing from the previous text, we see that dividing into just two sides ends up doing omissions (<htcite9>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left htSlidePrev\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(-1);\"></i>\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right htSlideNext\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(1);\"></i>\n</div></p>",
